# File Header Metadata Convention

For new or substantially modified project files, add a short header comment near the top with:

- `Author` (use explicit name when provided)
- `Purpose` (1 concise sentence)
- `Last updated` (ISO date `YYYY-MM-DD`)

## JavaScript / JSX Example

```js
/**
 * Author: Igor Michel
 * Purpose: Render role-aware leave application details and actions.
 * Last updated: 2026-02-28
 */
```

## Notes

- Keep headers concise (3-5 lines).
- Do not add noisy line-by-line comments for obvious code.
- Update `Last updated` when behavior changes.
